---
config:
  theme: neo
description: >-
  Label icons (@mermaid-js/plugin-icons, I3 #324) in an entity alias, a relationship label and
  an attribute comment, in the neo theme. fa:fa-bell is filled with currentColor, fal:fa-circle-
  check stroked with it: both take the label's text colour, so the four theme families differ by
  colour only (D215, D227).
---
erDiagram
  ALARM["fa:fa-bell Alarm"] {
    string id PK "fal:fa-circle-check key"
    int volume "fa:fa-bell loud"
  }
  ALARM ||--o{ CHECK : "fal:fa-circle-check runs"
